+# Current project status
+
+Write the current snapshot, not a dated log. Replace these instructions with observed facts; use stable project-relative references. Update the existing entry for this task, keeping other active plans intact.
+
+- **Goal and plan:** name the actual task and active plan or state that none has started.
+- **Verified progress:** completed unit and evidence (test, tracked artifact or commit); identify partial work separately.
+- **Latest validation:** actual command, date or revision, conditions and outcome. If no applicable check ran, say so.
+- **Open work / blockers:** failing observation, unverified claim, missing input or unevaluated unit.
+- **Next action:** one executable next step, including CE recovery pointer if a real run is in progress.
+- **Related knowledge:** link only relevant existing ADRs, research or solutions. Omit vacant links.
